msgstr "Agregarla yo a mi calendario"

#: includes/notifications/class-elab-notifications.php:198
msgid "Can’t wait? Add it to your calendar yourself. The site then stops trying to add it, so the call appears only once."
msgstr "¿No puedes esperar? Agrégala tú a tu calendario. El sitio deja entonces de intentarlo, así que la llamada aparece una sola vez."

#: includes/notifications/class-elab-notifications.php:201
msgid "You added this call to your calendar yourself, so the site cannot remove it. Please delete that event in your calendar."
msgstr "Agregaste esta llamada a tu calendario tú mismo, así que el sitio no puede quitarla. Borra ese evento de tu calendario."

#: includes/notifications/class-elab-notifications.php:202
msgid "This call was created in your main Google Calendar before the dedicated calendar existed. Please delete that event there by hand."
msgstr "Esta llamada se creó en tu calendario principal de Google antes de que existiera el calendario dedicado. Borra ese evento allí manualmente."

#: includes/notifications/class-elab-notifications.php:204
msgid "Google did not answer, so the event will be removed from your calendar automatically as soon as it does."
msgstr "Google no respondió, así que el evento se quitará de tu calendario automáticamente en cuanto responda."

